": 2134, "text": "He formed a deadly strike partnership with teammate James McLaughlin, and together they terrorized defenses across the league."}, "D1S23": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2135, "end": 2319, "text": "In the 2017-2018 season, Patterson's 23 goals in 38 appearances earned him the NIFL Premiership Golden Boot, cementing his status as one of the top strikers in Northern Irish football."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 124, "text": "As the crisp Helsinki air whipped through the streets, Rory Patterson stepped off the bus and onto the snow-dusted pavement."}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 125, "end": 253, "text": "The Northern Irishman had grown accustomed to the Finnish capital's chill, but it still caught him off guard every now and then."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 254, "end": 385, "text": "He zipped up his jacket, emblazoned with the crest of his new club, HJK Helsinki, and made his way to the team's training facility."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 386, "end": 486, "text": "Rory's thoughts drifted back to the conversation he'd had with his agent, Markku, a few weeks prior."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 487, "end": 599, "text": "\"You're a natural fit for the Finnish league, Rory,\" Markku had said, his thick accent dripping with conviction."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 600, "end": 659, "text": "\"And who knows, maybe even a call-up to the national team?\""}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 660, "end": 783, "text": "Rory had laughed it off at the time, but now, as he gazed out at the frozen landscape, the idea didn't seem so far-fetched."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 784, "end": 932, "text": "As he entered the training complex, Rory was greeted by the familiar sight of his teammates, their faces a mix of Fi